WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.437
- So wait, so Ben posted
this photo and said,

00:00:02.437 --> 00:00:04.500
"Circumstances shall remain mysterious."

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.529
So -

00:00:05.529 --> 00:00:06.480
(laughter)

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.000
I mean, I live next door to you

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.523
and I, like, what's
going on in your house?

00:00:11.523 --> 00:00:13.453
- This is Friday night.

00:00:13.453 --> 00:00:14.286
Truly.
- Yep. Truly.

00:00:14.286 --> 00:00:15.390
(laughter)
- This is Friday night.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:16.223
I'm not kidding.

00:00:16.223 --> 00:00:17.250
We've done it for over a year.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.083
We have a group.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:21.600
We started movie - a movie Zoom.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.433
Oh my God.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:23.266
It's a lot to look at.

00:00:23.266 --> 00:00:24.099
- Yep.

00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:25.250
- This is from what is it? Emile Zola?

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.280
- [Ben] The Life of Emile Zola.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.270
- [Kelly] The Life of Emile Zola.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.103
- [Melissa] It's amazing.

00:00:28.103 --> 00:00:29.760
We've watched every Best Picture winner

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.470
and we started over a year ago.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.303
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:32.303 --> 00:00:34.410
- And by the time we got
to Lawrence of Arabia

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.090
we had one of our friends, Steve Mallory,

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.584
who's in God's Favorite Idiot.

00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:41.160
He showed up, he joined
the group on that one,

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.330
'cause it's his favorite movie.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.980
And he showed up in full costume.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.813
- Wow.

00:00:44.813 --> 00:00:47.430
- And it's a bunch of actors
and directors and producers.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.051
And literally people were like,
oh, we're doing that? Okay.

00:00:50.051 --> 00:00:51.651
And so one by one every -

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:52.484
- [Kelly] It got competitive.

00:00:52.484 --> 00:00:56.190
- And now we show up every
Friday on Zoom in full costume.

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:57.379
There's some drinks.

00:00:57.379 --> 00:00:58.307
(laughter)

00:00:58.307 --> 00:00:59.430
- And then we do a Q &amp; A,

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.800
we watch the movie during
the week, we do a Q &amp; A,

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.530
and then there's dumb
prizes for whoever wins it.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.810
- I love this. So did
this all start in Zoom?

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:08.440
Like in, in Zoom, in quarantine?

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.273
- Yeah.

00:01:09.273 --> 00:01:10.106
- And then it, yeah. That's so cool!

00:01:10.106 --> 00:01:10.939
- Cause we were like, what do we do?

00:01:10.939 --> 00:01:11.772
We hadn't seen anyone.

00:01:11.772 --> 00:01:12.930
And we're like, we're going crazy.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:13.763
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:13.763 --> 00:01:15.780
- Yeah. So it becomes a
thing where now on Friday

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.152
we're like "how do I - I need
to be a bagel for the movie.

00:01:19.152 --> 00:01:19.985
(laughter)

00:01:19.985 --> 00:01:20.818
And you're like, everybody's like,

00:01:20.818 --> 00:01:22.110
how do we make a bagel suit?

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:24.660
- Some have been so
elaborate, like some weeks,

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.640
like I went through a period where I was

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.980
making really huge things and Ben's like,

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:30.090
we need to be able to sit down.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.850
- For Forrest Gump we were
the box of chocolates.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.073
It was pretty amazing.

00:01:34.073 --> 00:01:34.906
- Oh my God!

00:01:34.906 --> 00:01:35.739
- [Melissa] But it was bigger.

00:01:35.739 --> 00:01:36.572
It was like, I made a box of chocolates

00:01:36.572 --> 00:01:37.937
that's the size of that rug

00:01:37.937 --> 00:01:38.770
- [Kelly] Y'all are so fun!

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:39.603
- And then two of our heads

00:01:39.603 --> 00:01:41.970
came through and then I decorated it all,

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.153
But then it was like, oh God,

00:01:43.153 --> 00:01:46.289
three hours is a long
time to stand like this.

00:01:46.289 --> 00:01:47.370
(laughter)

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.140
Like I didn't think it through!

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:52.470
- All I'm feeling is like
your lazy apathetic neighbor.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.720
Like I'm like, by the way,
while you're doing that

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:57.753
I'm just like laying on
my couch, like, so tired.

